**/0_never-push-this-dump-folder/
**/.codebuddy/
**/.workbuddy-ai/

# Deployment tooling metadata (contains project ids)
**/.vercel/

# Dependencies and generated output
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/coverage/

# Local environment and runtime files
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.log

# Supabase CLI local metadata
supabase/.temp/

# Temporary scratch / verification scratchpad (duplicates public assets)
**/.tmp-verify/

# Compiled output must never sit next to its TypeScript source. `shared-types`
# compiles src -> dist; stale `src/*.js` files were committed once, and any tool
# that prefers `.js` over `.ts` would silently resolve the stale build instead.
packages/shared-types/src/**/*.js

# Working documents that are deliberately kept off the remote. This is the
# manager's own planning file for the Geist font work; it is read locally and
# never pushed. Ignoring it (rather than just leaving it untracked) means a
# `git add -A` cannot sweep it into a commit by accident.
docs/geist-font-plan.md